   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In January 2022, the Central Statistical Administration in Lebanon conducted a follow-up labour force survey following the latest international statistical standards. The survey provided a broad array of labour market and demographic indicators. Through RBSA funds, the ILO provided technical assistance to the Central Statistical Administration to ensure successful implementation in times of crises. Technical support included assistance in questionnaire design, statistical training, tabulation, and development of data analysis.</narrative>
   </description>
